<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-πέσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bake a crust round</i> : only metaph.,
				<i>disguise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνόματι π. τὴν μοχθηρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					159
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αὑτὰς προσθέτοις</span>
			<i>deck</i> themselves <i>out.</i> with false hair, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				321
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπλασμένως τὸ πρᾶγμα
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Bato
				7.6
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀβλαβῶς</span>
			<i>cover</i> Marius without hurting him, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				37
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πεσεῖν</span> codd.) :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ἄνδρες] Χλανίσι περιπεπεμμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοισιν εὖ πως εἰς τὸ πιθανὸν
				περιπεπεμμένα</span>
			<i>dressed up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				886e
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῦπαι ἡδοναῖς περιπεπεμμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1.20
				</span></i>
			 ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηματίοις περιπεφθείς</span>
			<i>cajoled</i> by words, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				668
			</span></i>.</div>
